# repress.scn: a release and re-press within one idle, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# With no tick, each idle runs from RTC edge to RTC edge at the launcher's clock, half a second, so Timer 0 wakes rt_idle
# once at its capped segment before the edge. Up is released at idle 2's start and pressed again after that wake: the
# poll at the wake sees the release and re-arms Up, so the new press latches the line again.
enable 0x001F
press 0x10 1
idle 1
release 0x10 2
press 0x10 2
idle 2
log_buttons
